<p style=3D"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-heig=
ht:1.5;color:#1f2933;margin:0 0 12px;"><strong>What changed</strong></p>
<p style=3D"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-heig=
ht:1.5;color:#1f2933;margin:0 0 12px;">In the Phase 3 DeLLphi-305 trial, main=
tenance tarlatamab plus durvalumab produced median overall survival of 21.1 m=
onths versus 12.7 months with durvalumab alone after initial chemo-immunother=
apy=E2=80=94a 58% reduction in mortality risk. Median progression-free surviv=
al was 7.4 versus 1.9 months. Grade 3-or-higher adverse events occurred in 46=
.8% versus 40.6%; cytokine-release syndrome occurred in roughly half of combi=
nation-treated patients but was overwhelmingly low grade. The results were pu=
blished October 24 in the <a href=3D"https://www.nejm.org/doi/full/10.1056/NE=
JMoa2609482" style=3D"color:#1a5e9a;text-decoration:underline;"><em>New Engla=
nd Journal of Medicine</em></a>. (<a href=3D"https://www.astrazeneca-us.com/m=
edia/press-releases/2026/IMFINZI-durvalumab-plus-tarlatamab-dlle-reduced-the-=
risk-of-death-by-58-percent-in-1st-line-extensive-stage-small-cell-lung-cance=
r-in-the-DeLLphi-305-Phase-III-trial1.html?utm_source=3Dopenai" style=3D"colo=
r:#1a5e9a;text-decoration:underline;">astrazeneca-us.com</a>)</p>
<p style=3D"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-heig=
ht:1.5;color:#1f2933;margin:0 0 12px;"><strong>What it tells us</strong></p>
<p style=3D"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-heig=
ht:1.5;color:#1f2933;margin:0 0 12px;">This is not an incremental maintenance=
 improvement. It moves a DLL3-directed T-cell engager from later-line validat=
ion into the first-line treatment architecture of an aggressive cancer and st=
rengthens the strategic case for antigen-specific engagers in solid tumors. T=
he survival benefit across patients with liver or brain metastases further re=
duces the likelihood that the result reflects a favorable subgroup.</p>
<p style=3D"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-heig=
ht:1.5;color:#1f2933;margin:0 0 12px;"><strong>What to watch next</strong></p>
<p style=3D"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-heig=
ht:1.5;color:#1f2933;margin:0 0 12px;">Regulatory timing, community-oncology =
readiness to manage early cytokine-release syndrome, and whether first-line a=
doption expands the total tarlatamab-treated population or largely displaces =
later-line use.</p>
<h4 style=3D"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:15px;color:#1=
2395b;margin:16px 0 6px;">Personalized mRNA succeeded where last week=E2=80=
=99s fixed-antigen vaccine failed</h4>
<p style=3D"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-heig=
ht:1.5;color:#1f2933;margin:0 0 12px;"><strong>What changed</strong></p>
<p style=3D"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-heig=
ht:1.5;color:#1f2933;margin:0 0 12px;">Detailed Phase 3 INTerpath-001 results=
 showed intismeran autogene plus pembrolizumab reduced recurrence or death by=
 42% versus pembrolizumab alone in 1,137 patients with resected stage IIB=E2=
=80=93IV melanoma. Two-year recurrence-free survival was 82.2% versus 70.0%; =
distant-metastasis-free survival was 88.5% versus 80.2%. Overall survival rem=
ains immature and was not statistically significant. Grade 3=E2=80=935 treatm=
ent-related adverse events were comparable=E2=80=9414.2% versus 13.4%=E2=80=
=94although fever and injection-site pain affected approximately half of vacc=
ine recipients. (<a href=3D"https://www.merck.com/news/merck-and-moderna-will=
-present-results-from-landmark-phase-3-interpath-001-trial-for-intismeran-aut=
ogene-plus-keytruda-pembrolizumab-at-esmo-2026-presidential-symposium/" style=
=3D"color:#1a5e9a;text-decoration:underline;">Merck and Moderna, October 22</=
a>) (<a href=3D"https://www.merck.com/news/merck-and-moderna-will-present-res=
ults-from-landmark-phase-3-interpath-001-trial-for-intismeran-autogene-plus-k=
eytruda-pembrolizumab-at-esmo-2026-presidential-symposium/" style=3D"color:#1=
a5e9a;text-decoration:underline;">merck.com</a>)</p>
<p style=3D"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-heig=
ht:1.5;color:#1f2933;margin:0 0 12px;"><strong>What it tells us</strong></p>
<p style=3D"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-heig=
ht:1.5;color:#1f2933;margin:0 0 12px;">The result validates individualized ne=
oantigen selection in a pivotal trial and narrows the interpretation of BNT11=
3=E2=80=99s failure: mRNA itself was not the central problem; antigen breadth=
 and personalization may be decisive. The 12.2-point absolute recurrence-free=
-survival difference is clinically substantial, but melanoma does not yet est=
ablish efficacy across less immunogenic tumors.</p>
<p style=3D"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-heig=
ht:1.5;color:#1f2933;margin:0 0 12px;">Commercial execution now becomes part =
of the product profile. Tumor sequencing, individualized design, manufacturin=
g turnaround and cost must operate reliably at scale; these are materially di=
fferent constraints from conventional biologics.</p>
<p style=3D"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-heig=
ht:1.5;color:#1f2933;margin:0 0 12px;"><strong>What to watch next</strong></p>
<p style=3D"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-heig=
ht:1.5;color:#1f2933;margin:0 0 12px;">Regulatory filing plans, overall survi=
val, manufacturing turnaround, and readouts in lung, bladder and kidney cance=
rs.</p>
<h4 style=3D"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:15px;color:#1=
2395b;margin:16px 0 6px;">Hibsago turns hepatitis B functional cure into an a=
pproved=E2=80=94but selected=E2=80=94treatment objective</h4>
<p style=3D"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-heig=
ht:1.5;color:#1f2933;margin:0 0 12px;"><strong>What changed</strong></p>
<p style=3D"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-heig=
ht:1.5;color:#1f2933;margin:0 0 12px;">FDA approved GSK and Ionis=E2=80=99s b=
epirovirsen, branded Hibsago, on October 20 for noncirrhotic adults with supp=
ressed HBV DNA and HBsAg levels of 3,000 IU/mL or lower. Six months of treatm=
ent produced functional cure=E2=80=94undetectable HBsAg and HBV DNA after sto=
pping therapy=E2=80=94in 19% of patients versus none on standard therapy; the=
 rate reached 26% when baseline HBsAg was 1,000 IU/mL or lower. (<a href=3D"h=
ttps://us.gsk.com/en-us/media/press-releases/hibsago-bepirovirsen-approved-in=
-the-us-for-the-treatment-of-chronic-hepatitis-b-chb/" style=3D"color:#1a5e9a=
;text-decoration:underline;">GSK approval announcement</a>) (<a href=3D"https=
://www.nejm.org/doi/abs/10.1056/NEJMoa2515131?utm_source=3Dopenai" style=3D"c=
olor:#1a5e9a;text-decoration:underline;">nejm.org</a>)</p>
<p style=3D"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-heig=
ht:1.5;color:#1f2933;margin:0 0 12px;">The label requires two injections per =
dose, frequent liver testing and at least weekly platelet monitoring, and car=
ries a boxed warning for hepatic flares and potentially life-threatening thro=
mbocytopenia. (<a href=3D"https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/drugsatfda_docs/labe=
l/2026/221276Orig1s000lbl.pdf" style=3D"color:#1a5e9a;text-decoration:underli=
ne;">FDA prescribing information</a>) (<a href=3D"https://www.accessdata.fda.=
gov/drugsatfda_docs/label/2026/221276Orig1s000lbl.pdf" style=3D"color:#1a5e9a=
;text-decoration:underline;">accessdata.fda.gov</a>)</p>
<p style=3D"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-heig=
ht:1.5;color:#1f2933;margin:0 0 12px;"><strong>What it tells us</strong></p>
<p style=3D"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-heig=
ht:1.5;color:#1f2933;margin:0 0 12px;">Bepirovirsen creates a finite-treatmen=
t, functional-cure market rather than merely competing with inexpensive chron=
ic antivirals. Its strongest commercial population will likely be patients wi=
th low baseline HBsAg and high motivation to stop long-term therapy. Safety m=
onitoring, diagnostic segmentation and the 81% overall non-cure rate will pre=
vent immediate broad replacement of nucleos(t)ide analogues.</p>
