advanced-rectal-cancer" style=3D"color:#1a5e9a;text-decoration:underline;">FD=
A approval notice</a>) (<a href=3D"https://www.fda.gov/drugs/resources-inform=
ation-approved-drugs/fda-grants-accelerated-approval-dostarlimab-locally-adva=
nced-rectal-cancer?utm_source=3Dopenai" style=3D"color:#1a5e9a;text-decoratio=
n:underline;">fda.gov</a>)</p>
<p style=3D"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-heig=
ht:1.5;color:#1f2933;margin:0 0 12px;"><strong>What it tells us</strong></p>
<p style=3D"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-heig=
ht:1.5;color:#1f2933;margin:0 0 12px;">For the roughly 3% of locally advanced=
 rectal cancers with this biomarker profile, avoiding surgery and chemoradiat=
